				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Lauren Donovan 3rd degree connection3rd<br />Director of Marketing at Third Door Media</p><p>Third Door Media</p><p>Montclair State University<br />New York City Metropolitan Area Contact info<br />500+ connections</p><p>Message</p><p>More<br />HighlightsHighlights<br />Lauren is celebrating 10 years at Third Door MediaLauren is celebrating 10 years at Third Door Media</p><p>Message<br />AboutAbout<br />I have worked in online marketing since 2006, specializing in event marketing, content management, organic and paid social media, community and reputation management, and real-time journalism.</p><p>I currently serve as Director of Marketing at Third Door Media &#8212; producer of the Search Marketing Expo and MarTech conference series and publishers of Search Engine Land and MarTech. My job is to help connect marketers from around the world with training opportunities and experiences that can help them achieve their professional goals.</p><p>My first business book, &#8220;The Complete Social Media Community Manager&#8217;s Guide: Essential Tools and Tactics for Business Success,&#8221; was released in January 2013 by Wiley/Sybex and can be found on Amazon.com: https://a.co/d/eK1xA4F</p><p>Tên công ty: Nightfall</p><p>Tên tôi: Max</p><p>Viết một email tiếp cận lạnh lùng tới người sáng lập này, tên là Pranav, giới thiệu cho anh ấy sản phẩm của chúng tôi, một hệ thống CRM mới. Làm cho email trang trọng nhưng vẫn dễ tiếp cận.</p>								</div>
